<http://data.silknow.org/object/5ab95eeb-7ff8-3464-b89b-a95a21796b2b/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Right front and back and left front of a man’s waistcoat made of cream silk taffeta, embroidered with coloured silks and silver filé in a pattern of flowers, feathers and wheat sheaves.  It has a round neckline, shaped pocket flaps and short skirts reaching to the top of the thigh..  The waistcoat is lined with fustian, backed and faced with cream silk twill."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/5ab95eeb-7ff8-3464-b89b-a95a21796b2b> .

